  "label": "Dog Snarl as Aggression Metaphor",
  "description": "The visual of the dog snarling is used as a metaphor for rage or hostility. This relies on the real-world understanding that dogs displaying such expressions are perceived as aggressive, which is then mapped onto the hateful text to amplify the message. This is a common meme trope where animal expressions are used to convey human emotions or attitudes.",
